+ * site), was silently discarded: conf_path_set() never ran,
+ * conf_path_get() fell back to its compiled-in default
+ * (`%APPDATA%\.baresip` on Windows), and the engine loaded whatever
+ * config/accounts happened to already exist there instead of the
+ * scratch-dir config/accounts this repo's shell had just written -
+ * including, critically, that scratch config's own `ctrl_json` module
+ * line, so the shell<->core control channel documented in
+ * core/PROTOCOL.md never even started.
+ *
+ * cent_getopt.h is a minimal, dependency-free stand-in for the small
+ * subset of POSIX getopt() semantics main() below actually needs, kept
+ * in its own header (rather than inlined here) so it can be unit-tested
+ * on its own - see core/patches/test/test_cent_getopt.c.
+ */
+#include "cent_getopt.h"
+#define getopt(argc, argv, optstring) cent_getopt(argc, argv, optstring)
+#define optarg cent_optarg
 #endif
 
 
